<main class="pc" data-product-academy="2"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / Academy</p><h1>From personal experience to professional competence.</h1><p class="pc-lead">CRANIO Academy is a practical learning architecture: personal understanding, professional observation and supervised practice.</p><p class="pc-note">Learning architecture · enquiry</p><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="#academy-stages">Three stages of preparation ↗</a><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Discuss training</a></div><section class="pc-section" id="academy-stages"><h2>Three stages of preparation</h2><div class="pc-learning"><details class="pc-card" open><summary><span class="pc-index">01</span><br>Outside in</summary><h3>Personal experience</h3><p>Become familiar with the method, your own perceptions and comparison of states.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary><span class="pc-index">02</span><br>Inside out</summary><h3>System understanding</h3><p>Explore configuration, the language of observation, theory and practical principles.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary><span class="pc-index">03</span><br>Outside</summary><h3>Mentored practice</h3><p>Develop professional competencies under supervision, with feedback and assessment of readiness.</p></details></div></section><section class="pc-section"><h2>Competence architecture</h2><div class="pc-grid"><details class="pc-card"><summary>Observation</summary><p>Distinguish observed, measured, reported and exploratory concepts.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary>Configuration</summary><p>Describe head orientation and context without unsupported diagnosis.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary>Communication</summary><p>Agree on needs, scope, safety and voluntary participation.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary>Practice</summary><p>Develop practical competencies under supervision, not from website instructions.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary>Verification</summary><p>Compare observations under comparable conditions and record changes.</p></details><details class="pc-card"><summary>Continuity</summary><p>Maintain observation history with consent and respect confidentiality.</p></details></div></section><section class="pc-section"><h2>Choose your entry point</h2><div class="pc-learning"><article class="pc-card"><h3>I am exploring the method</h3><p>Start with personal experience and observation.</p><a class="pc-link" href="../your-cranium/">I am exploring the method ↗</a></article><article class="pc-card"><h3>I am a practitioner</h3><p>Explore the method and discuss an individual format.</p><a class="pc-link" href="../method/">I am a practitioner ↗</a></article><article class="pc-card"><h3>I represent an organization</h3><p>Discuss preparation of an internal specialist (Russian corporate page).</p><a class="pc-link" href="../../ru/professions/for-companies/">I represent an organization ↗</a></article></div><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button" href="../../ru/specializations/">20 specializations and 137 parameters ↗</a></div><p class="pc-note">Russian-language reference materials.</p><p class="pc-note">The website presents the learning architecture, not an online course, licence or confirmed certification program. Requirements, mentor availability, timing and terms are discussed individually.</p><a class="pc-button primary" href="../start/">Discuss training ↗</a></section><section class="pc-section"><details class="pc-legacy"><summary>Existing educational materials</summary><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="crumbs">CRANIO / Education</div><h2>Education</h2><p class="lead">Learn to describe experience, record context, compare states and distinguish observation from interpretation. Professional training and certification are planned pathways; course enrollment is not available on this site yet.</p><section class="section"><h2>Continue exploring</h2><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="../experience/"><h3>For You</h3><p>Your experience</p></a><a class="card" href="../method/"><h3>Method</h3><p>Observe → Calibrate → Identify → Optimize → Verify</p></a><a class="card" href="../explore/"><h3>Explore</h3><p>Choose how deep to go</p></a></div></section><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../start/">Start</a></div></article></div></details></section></main>